{"t": "03:39:28", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:complaint.category+complaint.text+complaint.onset+complaint.pain_rating", "text": "I'm glad to hear she is alert. Could you tell me what happened, when it started, and how severe the pain is on a scale of 0 to 10?", "fields": ["complaint.category", "complaint.text", "complaint.onset", "complaint.pain_rating"], "offered": ["complaint.category", "complaint.text", "complaint.onset", "E.mechanism", "complaint.pain_rating", "M.medications"]}
{"t": "03:39:29", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:complaint.category+complaint.text+complaint.onset+complaint.pain_rating", "text": "She's been having a fever and shivering since this afternoon. I'm not sure about the pain level."}
