{"t": "03:39:34", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating", "text": "I understand she's had a fever and shivering since this afternoon. Since you aren't sure about the pain level, could you describe any other symptoms she's having or how uncomfortable she feels?", "fields": ["complaint.pain_rating"], "offered": ["complaint.pain_rating", "M.medications", "A.allergies", "history.conditions", "history.immunocompromised", "history.pregnant_or_postpartum"]}
{"t": "03:39:36", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating", "text": "She is very tired and has been shivering. She is awake and talking, but she's been feeling unwell since the fever started this afternoon."}
{"t": "03:39:37", "kind": "extract", "writes": [["infection.fever", true]]}
{"t": "03:39:40", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating", "text": "I'm sorry to hear she's feeling so unwell. Even if it's not a sharp pain, could you describe how uncomfortable she is or give a general sense of her distress level?", "fields": ["complaint.pain_rating"], "offered": ["complaint.pain_rating", "M.medications", "A.allergies", "history.conditions", "history.immunocompromised", "history.pregnant_or_postpartum"]}
{"t": "03:39:41", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:complaint.pain_rating", "text": "She's very tired and shivering from the fever. She is awake and talking, but she's clearly not feeling well."}
{"t": "03:39:43", "kind": "extract", "writes": [["infection.fever", true]]}
{"t": "03:39:45", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:M.medications+A.allergies+history.conditions+history.immunocompromised", "text": "I'm sorry she's feeling so poorly. Does she take any regular medications, and does she have any known allergies or other medical conditions like diabetes or heart problems?", "fields": ["M.medications", "A.allergies", "history.conditions", "history.immunocompromised"], "offered": ["M.medications", "A.allergies", "history.conditions", "history.immunocompromised", "history.pregnant_or_postpartum", "infection.rash"]}
{"t": "03:39:47", "kind": "answer", "slot": "dyn:M.medications+A.allergies+history.conditions+history.immunocompromised", "text": "She takes capecitabine and omeprazole. She has no known allergies and no other medical conditions like diabetes or heart problems."}
{"t": "03:39:49", "kind": "extract", "writes": [["M.medications", ["capecitabine", "omeprazole"]], ["A.allergies", []], ["history.conditions", []]]}
{"t": "03:39:51", "kind": "question", "slot": "dyn:history.immunocompromised+history.pregnant_or_postpartum", "text": "I'm sorry she's feeling so poorly. Could you tell me if she has any conditions that affect her immune system or if she is currently pregnant or recently gave birth?", "fields": ["history.immunocompromised", "history.pregnant_or_postpartum"], "offered": ["history.immunocompromised", "history.pregnant_or_postpartum", "infection.rash", "infection.travel_14d", "infection.contacts", "L.last_intake"]}
